<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:40:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>Shein 在印度的缓慢起步暴露了亿万富翁安巴尼零售实力的局限性</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/shein-s-slow-india-start-lays-bare-limits-of-billionaire-ambani-s-retail-might</link><description>Shein Global Holdings Ltd. 通过当地合作伙伴重返印度的计划起步缓慢，原因是供应链障碍、领导层的不确定性以及缺乏使这个快时尚品牌大受欢迎的专有技术。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/shein-s-slow-india-start-lays-bare-limits-of-billionaire-ambani-s-retail-might'&gt;Shein 在印度的缓慢起步暴露了亿万富翁安巴尼零售实力的局限性&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Shein’s Slow India Start Lays Bare Limits of Billionaire Ambani’s Retail Might&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/shein-s-slow-india-start-lays-bare-limits-of-billionaire-ambani-s-retail-might</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:31:20 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</link><description>在华尔街后期复苏将纳斯达克100指数从熊市边缘拉出来之后，亚洲股市似乎有望小幅上涨，同时对人工智能交易可持续性的持续担忧提振了美国国债。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates'&gt;亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Asian Stocks Rise as Tech Gains in Taiwan, Korea: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:10:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>由于波动性打击金属，铜价从今年最低点反弹</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/copper-rebounds-from-lowest-this-year-as-volatility-hits-metals</link><description>尽管人们对人工智能繁荣和相关工业金属需求的持久性仍存疑虑，但铜价从 11 个月低点上涨逾 3%，追随科技股的涨幅。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/copper-rebounds-from-lowest-this-year-as-volatility-hits-metals'&gt;由于波动性打击金属，铜价从今年最低点反弹&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Copper Rebounds From Lowest This Year as Volatility Hits Metals&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/copper-rebounds-from-lowest-this-year-as-volatility-hits-metals</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:01:10 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>KK Mart 启动 1.12 亿美元的 IPO，因马来西亚 Socks Row 推迟</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/kk-mart-starts-112-million-ipo-delayed-by-malaysia-socks-row</link><description>马来西亚连锁便利店 KK Mart Retail Bhd. 由于宗教争议而推迟了首次公开募股，该公司正在启动 4.62 亿林吉特（1.12 亿美元）的股票发售，准备在全国增加数百家门店。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/kk-mart-starts-112-million-ipo-delayed-by-malaysia-socks-row'&gt;KK Mart 启动 1.12 亿美元的 IPO，因马来西亚 Socks Row 推迟&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：KK Mart Starts $112 Million IPO Delayed by Malaysia Socks Row&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/kk-mart-starts-112-million-ipo-delayed-by-malaysia-socks-row</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:03:11 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>印度 11 月股市流入达 147 亿美元，卢比创 8 个月新高</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-26/rupee-hits-8-month-high-as-india-november-stock-inflows-reach-14-7-billion</link><description>澳新银行集团认为卢比兑美元还有进一步升值至 90-91 卢比的空间。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-26/rupee-hits-8-month-high-as-india-november-stock-inflows-reach-14-7-billion'&gt;印度 11 月股市流入达 147 亿美元，卢比创 8 个月新高&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Rupee Hits 8-Month High as India November Stock Inflows Reach $14.7 Billion&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-26/rupee-hits-8-month-high-as-india-november-stock-inflows-reach-14-7-billion</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:32:22 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>